        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    sales = [70, 40, 25]\n    probabilities = [0.05, 0.70, 0.25]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    expected_sales = sum(sale * probability for sale, probability in zip(sales, probabilities))\n    variance = sum(\n        probability * (sale - expected_sales) ** 2\n        for sale, probability in zip(sales, probabilities)\n    )\n    answer = round(variance ** 0.5, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
